Currying is a computable map of function spaces, and its neighbourhood relation is decidable.

<!-- formalization -->

**Theorem (`curryComb_rel_recDecidable`).** As set out for this part of the library.

*Proof.* By the enumeration of the two function spaces and the reduction of curry to the product presentation. ∎

